:null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":19,"created_at":"2026-09-11T11:26:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T22:41:04Z","closed_at":"2026-09-22T15:21:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123411","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123411","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123411.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123411.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-22T15:21:21Z"},"body":"Adds a new focusing method to the 3D editor based on the node's `AABB` center.\r\n\r\nCurrent focus (The old hotkey was **F**; in this PR, it is now **Ctrl+F**):\r\n\r\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e861b4e4-c494-4396-b251-6669291e04fb\" controls width=\"400\"></video>\r\n\r\nThis PR (Hotkey **F**):\r\n\r\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2259738d-dd0b-4114-8ed0-253d73ed642a\" controls width=\"400\"></video>\r\n\r\n**Edited.**\r\nUniform zooming added:\r\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7fbf80f-afc9-430b-99fa-aa99a74c4467\" controls width=\"400\"></video>\r\n\r\nWe focus on a specific visual component of the content, even if its anchor point is far away.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes [Add AABB-based node focus mode](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15507).\r\n- Closes [Add Frame Selection functionality to the 3D editor](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13447)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI noticed that they have started trying to use `LocalVector` within the engine core, so I used it as well.\r\n\r\nAI intelligence was used to locate the file specifying the hotkey (**F**).\r\n\r\nThe 3D model is taken from [here](https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/ponytail-hair-for-character-8ddc5c1c6cda49bc80c9f3a675b0a6c4).\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123411/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123411/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}